    "normal_en": "Orderly 4-step DORA handshake: Client broadcasts Discover, Server sends Offer, Client requests offered IP, Server acknowledges with ACK containing subnet, gateway, DNS, and lease time.",
    "normal_zh": "標準 DHCP 4 步驟 DORA 流程：客戶端廣播 Discover 搜尋、伺服器提供 Offer IP、客戶端發送 Request 請求租用、伺服器回覆 ACK 確認租約，並帶有子網路遮罩、預設閘道與 DNS 資訊。",
    "issue_en": "Rogue DHCP Server / Address Pool Exhaustion / DHCP NAK: Unauthorized rogue router offers malicious gateway/DNS; or pool exhaustion leads to unanswered Discovers; or NAK rejects client renewal.",
    "issue_zh": "私設/惡意 DHCP 伺服器 (Rogue DHCP) / 位址池耗盡 / DHCP NAK 拒絕：未授權的分享器搶先回覆 Offer 提供惡意 DNS 與閘道；或是位址池耗盡無回應；或跨網段搬移時收到 NAK 導致網卡無法連線。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'dhcp || bootp'. Check 'bootp.option.type == 53'. Verify 'ip.src' in Offer and ACK packets to confirm responses originate solely from the authorized server IP.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "輸入過濾器 'dhcp || bootp'。檢查 'bootp.option.type == 53' (訊息類型)。特別檢視回覆 Offer/ACK 的來源 'ip.src'，確認發送者是否為合法伺服器；若出現未知來源 IP，即代表網段內存在私設 DHCP 伺服器。",
    "title_zh": "Bootparams.Cap",
    "description_zh": "bootparams.cap.gz (libpcap) A couple of rpc.bootparamsd 'getfile' and 'whoami' requests.。（此樣本提供研究通訊協定行為與除錯之用）",
    "study_tip_zh": "【正常行為】：標準 DHCP 4 步驟 DORA 流程：客戶端廣播 Discover 搜尋、伺服器提供 Offer IP、客戶端發送 Request 請求租用、伺服器回覆 ACK 確認租約，並帶有子網路遮罩、預設閘道與 DNS 資訊。 【排查重點】：輸入過濾器 'dhcp || bootp'。檢查 'bootp.option.type == 53' (訊息類型)。特別檢視回覆 Offer/ACK 的來源 'ip.src'，確認發送者是否為合法伺服器；若出現未知來源 IP，即代表網段內存在私設 DHCP 伺服器。"
