    "id": "CAP-069",
    "filename": "isl-2-dot1q.cap",
    "title": "isl 2 dot1q",
    "level": 2,
    "level_name": "Intermediate",
    "level_badge": "Level 2: Intermediate",
    "level_color": "blue",
    "situation_id": "infrastructure_routing",
    "situation_name": "Enterprise Routing, Switching & Infrastructure",
    "situation_slug": "06_enterprise_routing_switching",
    "situation_icon": "fa-route",
    "situation_color": "blue",
    "category_h2": "General / Unsorted",
    "category_h3": "",
    "category_h4": "",
    "hierarchy": "General / Unsorted",
    "description": "isl-2-dot1q.cap (libpcap) A trace including both ISL and 802.1q-tagged Ethernet frames. Frames 1 through 381 represent traffic encapsulated using Cisco's ISL, frames 382-745 show traffic sent by the same switch after it had been reconfigured to support 802.1Q trunking.",
    "format": "libpcap",
    "size_bytes": 71216,
    "size_formatted": "69.5 KB",
    "protocols": [
      "TCP",
      "IP"
    ],
    "display_filter": "tcp",
    "study_tip": "Look at the 802.1Q VLAN tag (TPID 0x8100), 3-bit Priority Code Point (PCP for QoS), and 12-bit VLAN Identifier (VID).",
    "tshark_cmd": "tshark -r \"captures/06_enterprise_routing_switching/isl-2-dot1q.cap\" -Y \"tcp\"",
    "relative_path": "captures/06_enterprise_routing_switching/isl-2-dot1q.cap",
    "original_wiki_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/SampleCaptures#General%20/%20Unsorted",
    "normal_en": "Switch trunk port encapsulates frames with 4-byte 802.1Q header containing matching VLAN ID and Priority Code Point (PCP) for traffic isolation across switches.",
    "normal_zh": "交換器 Trunk 聚合埠於乙太網路訊框插入 4 位元組之 802.1Q 標頭，帶有合法的 VLAN ID (1-4094) 與優先等級 (PCP)，以實現跨交換器的虛擬區域網隔離與轉發。",
    "issue_en": "VLAN Hopping / Native VLAN Mismatch / Trunk Pruning Failure: Mismatched native VLAN tags leak broadcast packets between different subnets; or double-tagging attacks hop VLAN boundaries.",
    "issue_zh": "VLAN 跳躍攻擊 (VLAN Hopping) / 本地 VLAN 不一致 / 廣播洩漏：交換器兩端 Native VLAN 設定不一致導致廣播流量洩漏至其他部門網段；或是雙重標記 (Double Tagging) 攻擊越界存取隔離網路。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'vlan'. Expand the IEEE 802.1Q Virtual LAN header. Check 'vlan.id' and 'vlan.priority' to ensure frames match the intended tenant and switch trunk provisioning.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "輸入過濾器 'vlan'。展開封包列表中的 IEEE 802.1Q 標頭。檢驗 'vlan.id' 與 'vlan.priority'，確認封包是否符合預期的網段標籤，並檢查是否存在非預期的 Native VLAN 洩漏。",
