    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'ospf'. Inspect OSPF Hello packet headers for 'ospf.area_id', 'ospf.hello.hello_interval', and 'ospf.hello.dead_interval'. Verify matching MTU in Database Description (DBD) packets.",
