    "issue_en": "Port Reconnaissance & Vulnerability Probing: Rapid scanning across non-standard port numbers using abnormal flags (FIN scan, NULL scan, XMAS scan) to fingerprint active operating systems and listening daemons.",
    "issue_zh": "連接埠偵察與漏洞探測：在極短時間內對大量連接埠發送特殊旗標探針（如 FIN 掃描、NULL 掃描、XMAS 聖誕樹掃描），藉由目標的回應判斷主機作業系統版本與各通訊埠的開放狀態。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'tcp.flags'. Look for RST flags ('tcp.flags.reset == 1') returned by closed ports. Check Statistics -> Endpoints / Conversations -> TCP Ports to visualize the scanned destination port range.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "輸入過濾器 'tcp.flags' 檢視非典型旗標（如 URG+PSH+FIN 同時為 1）。目標關閉的連接埠會回覆帶有 RST ('tcp.flags.reset == 1') 的封包；未回覆或回覆 SYN-ACK 則為開啟。點選 Statistics -> Conversations 觀察被探測的連接埠廣度。",
    "title_zh": "Nmap Captures",
