    "original_wiki_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/SampleCaptures#General%20/%20Unsorted",
    "normal_en": "Packets exceeding MTU size are cleanly divided into fragments sharing the same Identification number, with Fragment Offset incrementing in 8-byte blocks and MF=0 on the last fragment.",
    "normal_zh": "超出鏈路 MTU 的封包會依序分割為多個分段，各分段共享相同的 Identification 識別碼，Fragment Offset (分段偏移植) 以 8 位元組為單位遞增，且最後一個分段的 MF 旗標設為 0。",
    "issue_en": "Fragmentation Failure & MTU Black Hole: Missing fragments prevent full reassembly, causing entire payload drops; or DF (Don't Fragment) bit set on oversized packets triggers ICMP Type 3 Code 4 drops without discovery.",
    "issue_zh": "IP 分段遺失與 MTU 黑洞：若路徑中有分段封包遺失，將導致接收端無法重組整個 IP 封包而將其全數丟棄；若發送端開啟 DF (Don't Fragment) 且封包大於中間 MTU，封包會被無聲拋棄形成 MTU 黑洞。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'ip.flags.mf == 1 || ip.frag_offset > 0'. Look at the Identification field to match fragments. Ensure Wireshark's 'Reassemble fragmented IPv4 datagrams' preference is enabled.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "輸入過濾器 'ip.flags.mf == 1 || ip.frag_offset > 0'。檢視 Identification (識別碼) 以追蹤屬於同一原始封包的分段。確認 Wireshark 已勾選「Reassemble fragmented IPv4 datagrams (重組 IPv4 分段)」選項。",
    "title_zh": "Tipc V2 Fragmenter Messages",
    "description_zh": "tipc_v2_fragmenter_messages.pcap.gz (libpcap) TIPCv2 Fragmenter Messages。（此樣本提供研究通訊協定行為與除錯之用）",
    "study_tip_zh": "【正常行為】：超出鏈路 MTU 的封包會依序分割為多個分段，各分段共享相同的 Identification 識別碼，Fragment Offset (分段偏移植) 以 8 位元組為單位遞增，且最後一個分段的 MF 旗標設為 0。 【排查重點】：輸入過濾器 'ip.flags.mf == 1 || ip.frag_offset > 0'。檢視 Identification (識別碼) 以追蹤屬於同一原始封包的分段。確認 Wireshark 已勾選「Reassemble fragmented IPv4 datagrams (重組 IPv4 分段)」選項。"
