    "relative_path": "captures/08_industrial_iot_wireless/arp-storm.pcap",
    "original_wiki_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/SampleCaptures#ARP/RARP",
    "normal_en": "Broadcast frames are bounded within single broadcast domains; unicast frames follow deterministically loop-free spanning tree paths.",
    "normal_zh": "區域網路廣播訊框受限於所屬 VLAN 網段；單播訊框依循無迴圈的生成樹協議 (STP) 路徑進行轉發，封包數量穩定。",
    "issue_en": "Switching Loop & Broadcast Storm: Redundant switch interlinks lacking Spanning Tree or misconfigured root bridge priority cause broadcast frames to circulate endlessly, saturating bandwidth.",
    "issue_zh": "交換器迴圈與廣播風暴：交換器間存在實體或邏輯冗餘鏈路，但因生成樹 (STP) 未啟用或配置失誤，導致廣播訊框（如 ARP、DHCP）在交換器間無限倍增循環，塞爆交換器 ASIC 晶片與鏈路頻寬，癱瘓整個 LAN。",
