    "normal_en": "ARP Request is broadcast to resolve an IP address ('Who has IP X?'); the authoritative host replies with a unicast ARP Reply declaring its MAC address.",
    "normal_zh": "標準 ARP 流程：發起端廣播 ARP Request 詢問「誰擁有此 IP？」；擁有該 IP 的目標主機以單播回覆 ARP Reply，通告其硬體 MAC 位址以建立對應表。",
    "issue_en": "ARP Spoofing / IP Conflict / Unresponsive Target: Gratuitous ARP packets broadcast conflicting MAC claims for the default gateway (MITM attack), or target host is offline leaving requests unanswered.",
    "issue_zh": "ARP 欺騙 (ARP Spoofing) / IP 衝突 / 節點未回應：惡意主機頻繁發送無故 ARP (Gratuitous ARP) 宣稱自己是預設閘道進行中間人竊聽；或是 IP 設定衝突，亦或是目標主機斷線導致大量未回應的 ARP 請求。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'arp'. Compare 'arp.opcode == 1' (Request) against 'arp.opcode == 2' (Reply). Check if multiple MAC addresses in 'arp.src.hw_mac' claim the same IP address.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "套用過濾器 'arp'。檢視 'arp.opcode == 1' (請求) 與 'arp.opcode == 2' (回覆)。核對 'arp.src.hw_mac' 是否出現不同的 MAC 位址宣稱擁有相同的預設閘道 IP，若有即為 ARP 欺騙攻擊或 IP 衝突。",
    "title_zh": "ARP 位址解析協議流量",
    "description_zh": "rarp_request.cap (libpcap) A reverse ARP request.。這段封包提供了標準的教學參考：包含區域網路廣播查詢 (Request) 與單播回覆 (Reply) 將 IP 位址解析為實體 MAC 位址的過程。",
