    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'stp'. Inspect 'stp.flags.tc == 1' (Topology Change) and 'stp.root.prio' (Root Bridge Priority). Audit which switch port is forwarding unauthorized BPDUs (activate BPDU Guard).",
