    "normal_en": "ICMP Echo Request (Type 8) generates an immediate ICMP Echo Reply (Type 0) with matching Identifier and Sequence Number and low round-trip latency.",
    "normal_zh": "標準 Ping 診斷：來源主機發出 ICMP Echo Request (Type 8)，目的端立即回覆 ICMP Echo Reply (Type 0)，雙方識別碼與序號完全匹配，延遲時間穩定。",
