    "description": "ws-cssp.tgz Contains RDP sessions from Windows and freerdp clients, featuring CredSSP over TLS, GSS-KRB5, SPNEGO and U2U (user-to-user). Certificate key and Kerberos keytab included.",
    "format": "libpcap",
