    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'tls.alert_message || tls.handshake.type == 1'. To decrypt payload, navigate to Edit -> Preferences -> Protocols -> TLS and load the (Pre)-Master-Secret log key file to view plaintext HTTP.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "套用過濾器 'tls.alert_message || tls.handshake.type == 1' 尋找警告或交握發起。若需解密資料，至 Edit -> Preferences -> Protocols -> TLS 載入 (Pre)-Master-Secret 金鑰紀錄檔，即可在 Wireshark 中直接解密檢視明文 HTTP 內容。",
    "title_zh": "Http Chunked Gzip",
    "description_zh": "http-chunked-gzip.pcap A single HTTP request and response for www.wireshark.org (proxied using socat to remove SSL encryption). Response is gzipped and used chunked encoding. Added in January 2016.。（此樣本提供研究通訊協定行為與除錯之用）",
    "study_tip_zh": "【正常行為】：標準 TLS 安全交握：Client Hello 提出支援的加密套件；Server Hello 決定加密演算法並出示合法的 X.509 憑證鏈，完成金鑰協商後以 Application Data 傳輸經過加密的應用層資料。 【排查重點】：套用過濾器 'tls.alert_message || tls.handshake.type == 1' 尋找警告或交握發起。若需解密資料，至 Edit -> Preferences -> Protocols -> TLS 載入 (Pre)-Master-Secret 金鑰紀錄檔，即可在 Wireshark 中直接解密檢視明文 HTTP 內容。"
