    "normal_en": "Client transmits HTTP Request (GET/POST) with proper headers; server replies with HTTP 200 OK (or 301/304 cache redirect) along with requested Content-Type data.",
    "normal_zh": "客戶端發送標準 HTTP 請求 (GET/POST) 並帶有合法標頭；伺服器正常回覆 HTTP 200 OK（或 301 重導向、304 快取未修改），並在 Body 傳輸正確的 Content-Type 資料。",
    "issue_en": "HTTP Client / Server Errors (4xx, 5xx): Server returns 400 Bad Request, 401/403 Forbidden, 404 Not Found, 500 Internal Error, or 504 Gateway Timeout during service failure.",
