    "issue_en": "Bearer Activation Failure / APN Rejection / Diameter Timeout: Cause code in Create Session Response returns failure (e.g. Missing/Unknown APN, User Authentication Failed, Roaming Not Allowed).",
    "issue_zh": "行動承載建立失敗 / APN 拒絕 / Diameter 認證逾時：Create Session Response 中的 Cause 代碼回傳失敗（如 APN 錯誤、使用者認證失敗、漫遊受限），導致手機無法取得行動數據連線。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'gtp || diameter || radius'. Look at 'gtp.cause' or 'diameter.Result-Code'. Check TEID allocation in GTP headers to confirm tunnel continuity between base station and core gateway.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "使用過濾器 'gtp || diameter || radius'。檢驗 'gtp.cause' 或 'diameter.Result-Code' 錯誤代碼。確認 GTP 標頭中的 TEID 數值在基地台與核心網閘道之間是否維持對應一致。",
