    "relative_path": "captures/03_security_and_cryptography/KasperskyPackets.CAP",
    "original_wiki_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/SampleCaptures#Kaspersky%20Update%20Protocol",
    "normal_en": "Hosts communicate strictly with recognized domain services over established ports with authenticated transactions and no random sequential scanning.",
    "normal_zh": "正常主機僅會透過已知的業務連接埠與特定伺服器通訊，傳送合法的 RPC/SMB 指令並通過身分驗證，絕不會在網段內發送密集連續的連接埠探測。",
    "issue_en": "Worm Outbreak & Exploitation: Infected host scans rapid IP ranges on TCP port 135/445, injecting buffer overflow shellcode payloads (e.g. MS03-026 / MS08-067) to execute remote code and spawn malware droppers.",
    "issue_zh": "蠕蟲病毒爆發與漏洞攻擊：受害主機在 TCP 135 或 445 連接埠高頻掃描隨機或連續 IP，注入特製的緩衝區溢位 Shellcode 攻擊負載（如 MS03-026、MS08-067 漏洞），藉此遠端執行惡意程式碼並觸發下載器。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'tcp.port == 135 || tcp.port == 445'. Inspect packet payload in the Hex dump window for repeated 0x90 NOP sleds and executable strings. Check Statistics -> Conversations to locate the source infected scanning host.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "在過濾列輸入 'tcp.port == 135 || tcp.port == 445'。在十六進位檢視視窗中檢查資料負載是否包含大量連續的 0x90 NOP Sled 與可疑字串。由 Statistics -> Conversations (對話) 快速鎖定大舉發送掃描的受感染主機 IP。",
    "title_zh": "Kasperskypackets",
    "description_zh": "Some examples of packets used by the Kaspersky AntiVirus Updater: KasperskyPackets.CAP。（此樣本提供研究通訊協定行為與除錯之用）",
    "study_tip_zh": "【正常行為】：正常主機僅會透過已知的業務連接埠與特定伺服器通訊，傳送合法的 RPC/SMB 指令並通過身分驗證，絕不會在網段內發送密集連續的連接埠探測。 【排查重點】：在過濾列輸入 'tcp.port == 135 || tcp.port == 445'。在十六進位檢視視窗中檢查資料負載是否包含大量連續的 0x90 NOP Sled 與可疑字串。由 Statistics -> Conversations (對話) 快速鎖定大舉發送掃描的受感染主機 IP。"
