    "description_zh": "kerberos-Delegation.zip An example of Kerberos Delegation in Windows Active Diretory.Keytaf file is also included.Please use Wireshark 0.10.14 SVN 17272 or above to open the trace.。（此樣本提供研究通訊協定行為與除錯之用）",
