    "relative_path": "captures/03_security_and_cryptography/amqps.pcapng",
    "original_wiki_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/SampleCaptures#SSL%20with%20decryption%20keys",
    "normal_en": "TLS Handshake: Client Hello presents supported cipher suites; Server Hello agrees on parameters, presents validated X.509 certificate chain, executes key exchange, and enters encrypted Application Data.",
    "normal_zh": "標準 TLS 安全交握：Client Hello 提出支援的加密套件；Server Hello 決定加密演算法並出示合法的 X.509 憑證鏈，完成金鑰協商後以 Application Data 傳輸經過加密的應用層資料。",
    "issue_en": "Handshake Failure / Expired Certificate / Cipher Mismatch: Server returns TLS Alert (e.g. Handshake Failure, Certificate Expired, Bad Record MAC); or lack of decryption keys obscures encrypted payloads.",
    "issue_zh": "TLS 交握失敗 / 憑證過期 / 加密套件不符：伺服器回傳 TLS Alert 警報（如 Handshake Failure、Certificate Expired 憑證失效、Bad Record MAC）；或是在沒有金鑰的情況下無法檢視封包內容。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'tls.alert_message || tls.handshake.type == 1'. To decrypt payload, navigate to Edit -> Preferences -> Protocols -> TLS and load the (Pre)-Master-Secret log key file to view plaintext HTTP.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "套用過濾器 'tls.alert_message || tls.handshake.type == 1' 尋找警告或交握發起。若需解密資料，至 Edit -> Preferences -> Protocols -> TLS 載入 (Pre)-Master-Secret 金鑰紀錄檔，即可在 Wireshark 中直接解密檢視明文 HTTP 內容。",
    "title_zh": "TLS / SSL 安全加密交握",
    "description_zh": "File: amqps.pcapng (AMQP using RabbitMQ server and Celery client) (5.1 KB, from https://git.lekensteyn.nl/peter/wireshark-notes/commit/tls/amqps.pcapng?id=3c00336b07f1fec0fb13af3c7d502d51fab732b7, SSL keys in capture file comments)。這段封包提供了標準的教學參考：展示 TLS Client Hello、Server Hello、密碼套件協商、X.509 憑證鏈出示與金鑰交換流程。",
    "study_tip_zh": "【正常行為】：標準 TLS 安全交握：Client Hello 提出支援的加密套件；Server Hello 決定加密演算法並出示合法的 X.509 憑證鏈，完成金鑰協商後以 Application Data 傳輸經過加密的應用層資料。 【排查重點】：套用過濾器 'tls.alert_message || tls.handshake.type == 1' 尋找警告或交握發起。若需解密資料，至 Edit -> Preferences -> Protocols -> TLS 載入 (Pre)-Master-Secret 金鑰紀錄檔，即可在 Wireshark 中直接解密檢視明文 HTTP 內容。"
