    "title_zh": "DNS 網域名稱解析查詢",
    "description_zh": "netlink-conntrack.pcap: Linux netlink, an HTTP request and DNS query with Netfilter (NFQUEUE and conntrack) packets. Used the conntrack -E command as listener.。這段封包提供了標準的教學參考：包含各種網域名稱查詢 (A, AAAA, CNAME)、遞迴解析、權威回答與快取 TTL 秒數的傳輸過程。",
