    "normal_en": "ICMP Echo Request (Type 8) generates an immediate ICMP Echo Reply (Type 0) with matching Identifier and Sequence Number and low round-trip latency.",
    "normal_zh": "標準 Ping 診斷：來源主機發出 ICMP Echo Request (Type 8)，目的端立即回覆 ICMP Echo Reply (Type 0)，雙方識別碼與序號完全匹配，延遲時間穩定。",
    "issue_en": "Destination Unreachable / TTL Expired in Transit / Firewall Drop: Router returns Type 3 (Unreachable) due to access control or route drop; or Type 11 (TTL Exceeded) signaling a routing loop.",
    "issue_zh": "目的端無法連線 / TTL 逾時 / 防火牆阻擋：中間路由器回傳 Type 3 (Destination Unreachable)，代表防火牆阻擋 (Code 13) 或無路由 (Code 0)；若回傳 Type 11 (TTL Expired)，代表封包在路由迴圈中耗盡壽命跳數。",
    "diagnosis_en": "Filter by 'icmp'. Check 'icmp.type' and 'icmp.code'. Expand the embedded original IP header inside ICMP error messages to identify which connection and port triggered the failure.",
    "diagnosis_zh": "套用過濾器 'icmp'。檢查 'icmp.type' 與 'icmp.code'。展開 ICMP 錯誤封包內部夾帶的原始 IP 標頭，即可精準看出是哪個原始連線與通訊埠在哪個中繼路由器上被阻斷。",
    "title_zh": "Notifylte",
    "description_zh": "notifyLTE.pcap \"Notify\" over LTE, just keeping the IPv6 prefix fresh。（此樣本提供研究通訊協定行為與除錯之用）",
    "study_tip_zh": "【正常行為】：標準 Ping 診斷：來源主機發出 ICMP Echo Request (Type 8)，目的端立即回覆 ICMP Echo Reply (Type 0)，雙方識別碼與序號完全匹配，延遲時間穩定。 【排查重點】：套用過濾器 'icmp'。檢查 'icmp.type' 與 'icmp.code'。展開 ICMP 錯誤封包內部夾帶的原始 IP 標頭，即可精準看出是哪個原始連線與通訊埠在哪個中繼路由器上被阻斷。"
