    "study_tip": "Inspect boundary testing, oversized fields, illegal characters, malformed headers, and how Wireshark dissectors handle edge-case protocol violations.",
    "tshark_cmd": "tshark -r \"captures/11_wireshark_testing_fuzzing/dhcp-nanosecond.pcap\" -Y \"bootp || dhcp\"",
